  "notes": "{得点|とくてん} refers to points earned in sports, games, tests, or competitions.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {得点|とくてん}する: to score\n- {得点|とくてん}を{挙|あ}げる: to score, earn points\n- {得点|とくてん}を{稼|かせ}ぐ: to rack up points\n- {得点|とくてん}{王|おう}: scoring champion/leader\n- {最高|さいこう}{得点|とくてん}: highest score\n- {合計|ごうけい}{得点|とくてん}: total score\n\nCONTEXTS:\n- Sports: {試合|しあい}で{得点|とくてん}する (score in a game)\n- Tests: テストの{得点|とくてん} (test score)\n- Games: ゲームの{得点|とくてん} (game score)\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {得点|とくてん}: points scored/earned\n- {失点|しってん}: points lost/conceded\n- {点数|てんすう}: score, marks (more general term for numerical scores)",
